# Interview content depth (~3–4 years experience)

When adding theory, tips, Q&A, or demos in this lab:

- Target **~3–4 years Java** interviews (mid-level).
- Keep: short definition, main APIs, 2–4 use cases, 1 common mistake, ≤5 Q&A.
- Avoid: Metaspace/Nashorn deep dives, staff-level Stream internals, long talk-tracks.
- Prefer coding-pattern clarity (groupingBy, flatMap, orElse vs orElseGet) over academic JMM.
